  "category": "Balloon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "The body is soft and rubbery. When angered, it will suck in air and inflate itself to an enormous size.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "The body is soft and rubbery. When angered, it will suck in air and inflate itself to an enormous size.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is full of elasticity. By inhaling deeply, it can continue to inflate itself without limit.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Their fur feels so good that if two of them snuggle together, they won't want to be separated.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has a very fine fur. Take care not to make it angry, or it may inflate steadily and hit with a BODY SLAM.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The rich, fluffy fur that covers its body feels so good that anyone who feels it can't stop touching it.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "WIGGLYTUFF has large, saucerlike eyes. The surfaces of its eyes are always covered with a thin layer of tears. If any dust gets in this POKéMON’s eyes, it is quickly washed away.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "WIGGLYTUFF’s body is very flexible. By inhaling deeply, this POKéMON can inflate itself seemingly without end. Once inflated, WIGGLYTUFF bounces along lightly like a balloon.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fur is the ultimate in luxuriousness. Sleeping alongside a WIGGLYTUFF is simply divine. Its body expands seemingly without end when it inhales.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fur is extremely fine, dense, and supple. The exquisitely pleasant fur conveys an image of luxury.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "The body is soft and rubbery. When angered, it will suck in air and inflate itself to an enormous size.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
