    },
    {
      "text": "Wigglytuff has large, saucerlike eyes. The surfaces of its eyes are always covered with a thin layer of tears. If any dust gets in this Pokémon’s eyes, it is quickly washed away.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wigglytuff’s body is very flexible. By inhaling deeply, this Pokémon can inflate itself seemingly without end. Once inflated, Wigglytuff bounces along lightly like a balloon.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sheds its fine fur when the seasons change. The fur is gathered and spun into a luxurious yarn.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it inhales, it expands...and expands...and expands. Wigglytuff compete to see which one can inflate itself the most.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to its bouncy body and fine fur, this Pokémon is sought after. Holding one in your arms while you sleep feels great.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it gets angry, it inhales with all its might, and its body gradually inflates. Sometimes they can grow 20 times larger!",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is very elastic. By inhaling deeply, it can continue to inflate itself without limit.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is very elastic. By inhaling deeply, it can continue to inflate itself without limit.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "The more air it takes in, the more it inflates. If opponents catch it in a bad mood, it will inflate itself to an enormous size to intimidate them.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s proud of its fur, which is fine and delicate. In particular, the curl on its forehead has a texture that’s perfectly heavenly.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
